---
description: Scope MCP codebase queries to mcp.json projects (unified codeup remote)
alwaysApply: true
---

# MCP projects scope (mcpverify)

This terminal uses the **unified** codebase remote at `http://127.0.0.1:18082/mcp`.

Read `.cursor/mcp.json` → `mcpServers.mcp-gateway.projects` (array of directory names under the codeup parent).

When calling MCP tools (`search`, `get_project_map`, `get_symbol`, etc.):

- Restrict paths and queries to those repositories only.
- Do not search or cite symbols outside `projects` unless the user explicitly asks for cross-repo work and updates `projects`.
